WEBVTT

00:05.520 --> 00:08.920
Your Highness said push him down can't you all hear?

00:12.080 --> 00:17.440
Your Highness His Majesty has given such generous terms shouldn't we just retreat back?

00:17.520 --> 00:19.800
Yes, Your Highness what did you say?

00:19.880 --> 00:23.067
Rebellion do you want to rebel?

00:25.000 --> 00:30.240
Good sirs good sirs Prince of Jin has defied the edict this will ruin.

00:30.320 --> 00:34.840
All your futures quickly seize him quickly seize him.

00:34.920 --> 00:37.587
Return to the capital with me for reward.

00:39.520 --> 00:44.280
Your Highness, we fought battles for you many brothers have died for the nation's great cause.

00:44.360 --> 00:48.440
We can't let you continue making mistakes brothers tie up Your Highness.

00:52.000 --> 01:00.500
The supply lines were intercepted once more, plunging the entire army into desperation. The troops were utterly exhausted, and could fight no longer.

